ww.board.mr2pages.com/showthread.php?threadid=2280</A> <P>"I just noticed tonight when I started up my 91T that there was a whistling/whining sound comming from the engine. I just kept driving and later tonight It felt like my turbo just died and my friend that was with me said "ooooohhh your car is smoking" " <A HREF="http://www.board.mr2pages.com/showthread.php?threadid=1390" TARGET=_blank>http://www.board.mr2pages.com/showthread.php?threadid=1390</A> <P>"I was driving my 91 MR2T and it started missing or hesitating when at idle or on the gas." <A HREF="http://www.board.mr2pages.com/showthread.php?threadid=754" TARGET=_blank>http://www.board.mr2pages.com/showthread.php?threadid=754</A> <P>"I slamed the gas in about 3rd gear and heard a pop,pop,pop....I looked back and seen a cloud of smoke. " <A HREF="http://www.board.mr2pages.com/showthread.php?threadid=134" TARGET=_blank>http://www.board.mr2pages.com/showthread.php?threadid=134</A> <P><BR>Sounds like you got the car cheap because it was a P.O.S.<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD||||reg||1
