Z||000069||MachineHead||12-18-2000||10:36 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by CUTTER:<BR><B>A ricer that could kick some fiero ass! haha, man im telling you's drive a MR2 turbo some day.....you will change your mind! It sure changed mine! I was tired of putting hundreds of dollars into my car every few weeks to fix my 87GT. Im running with the new z/28's and mustang cobras/gt's. Beat a 3000GT like it was sitting still. If you dont believe me go to my forrum and look it up in search. We also have videos of alot of stuff....my friend SoAngel on tape doing a I think it was a 5.7 0-60 and im super close to him in a race. lost by a few car(all on video tape on the forrum) lengths 20-145 mph. Im not bashing fieros I just like MR2's alot better. more reliable, faster, looks, interior...everything. A fiero was a good 1st car for me untill I hit a fence post and crushed the front bumper cover! then  looked into a supercar...thats why I have a 91 MR2 turbo!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Cobra's Camaros and 3000gt's would smoke you.||||reg||1
